  id: l2_maintenance_b
  title: Torn piece of card (oil-stained)
  body: '...3. CHOKE (yellow) - only with the needle in the green, or she dies on you.

    4. STARTER (green). Never before the choke.


    If she stalls, everything resets - begin again at 1.

    - D.'
